## System Prompt Best Practics

### Structure with Sections

- Use XML tags or markdown headers.
- Break into background, instructions, tool guidance

### Start Minimal and Iterate

- Dont anticipate every edge case
- Run against real tasks, observe failures, and add instructions!

### Use few shot examples

### Think about tool definitions

#### Put stable content at the top - system prompt, tool def. The things that do not change between the LLM calls.

- This will fire KV cache for context against LLM
- Put dynamic things at the bottom

#### Tool Masking

- keeping the list of tools - fairly unchanged. So, the context KV remains unchanged
- Also tell agent to not use certain tools by marking it masked and letting agent know.

### RAG-Based selection

- Use RAG and Semantic search to load only the correct tool  in the context

